{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The captured launchctl output shows six runs with exit code 1. The stderr log names the immediate failure: Claude says it is not logged in, and then zsh aborts on `status=$?` before the failure message can be sent. I also found that the notifier ignores the token already in the local config and tries the locked keychain. I’m fixing those paths and adding a check for an empty review."}}
